# (build 163) The attract crawl across Motavia in the retranslation: the
# crawl draws its box itself (draw_message), a line a row as the stock
# does, each line a run in his face on the box's fill -- his lines are up
# to 41 letters, past the box's 24 cells in the stock font. The second
# message, his "About a thousand years have passed since".
start new
language retranslation
wait screen level
wait script $1402
wait ticks 30
shot 01_second
expect pixel 65 144 $EEE       # the top of the A, where the stock row
                               # has paper
